---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="The Knowledge Base"
	description="Turning struggle and success into a scalable product."
	pubDate={new Date()}
	heroImage="/og-default.png"
>
	<h1>The Knowledge Base</h1>
	<p>
		Sovereignty isn't just about tools; it's about knowledge. We believe in turning the struggle of implementation into a roadmap for others.
	</p>
	<h2 class="resource">The Manual</h2>
	<p>
		Written SOPs and living documentation for self-hosting and sovereign operations.
	</p>
	<h2 class="resource">Masterclasses</h2>
	<p>
		Video step-by-steps for FOSS tool implementation, from Proxmox to TrueNAS.
	</p>
	<h2 class="resource">Build-Days</h2>
	<p>
		Small-group physical workshops for home-lab setup. Come get your hands dirty.
	</p>
</Layout>
